OL,3,GNEWSAFourth union joins strike at
OL,4,AGlasgow Caledonian university
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow Caledonian University is facing
OL,7,Feffective closure for one day this week
OL,8,Fafter a fourth union announced plans to
OL,9,Fstrike.
OL,11,FStaff with the Unite union are to join
OL,12,Fcolleagues from the UCU, the EIS and
OL,13,FUnison in walking out on Thursday.
OL,15,FThe dispute is over plans by management
OL,16,Fat the university to cut about 50 posts
OL,17,F- which could include compulsory
OL,18,Fredundancies - which they say will
OL,19,Fsecure the institution's finances.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
